# JVM Explorer — Execution Plan

> **Plan Version:** 1.0.0  
> **Status:** Active  
> **Derived From:** speckit.constitution

---

## Phase 0: Project Foundation

### 0.1 Repository & Tooling
- [ ] Initialize Git repository
- [ ] Set up monorepo structure (frontend/, backend/, infra/)
- [ ] Configure Java 21 + Maven/Gradle for backend
- [ ] Configure React + Vite for frontend
- [ ] Set up ESLint, Prettier, Checkstyle
- [ ] Configure Husky + lint-staged

### 0.2 CI/CD Pipeline
- [ ] GitHub Actions CI — build, lint, test
- [ ] Docker image builds for backend and frontend
- [ ] Terraform scaffolding for AWS infrastructure
- [ ] Staging environment deployment
- [ ] Production environment deployment

### 0.3 Container & Sandbox
- [ ] Docker Compose for local development
- [ ] Sandbox Docker image with resource limits
- [ ] Sandbox API — compile and execute user code
- [ ] Execution timeout, memory, CPU controls

### 0.4 Observability
- [ ] Structured logging (SLF4J + Logback)
- [ ] Metrics (Micrometer + CloudWatch)
- [ ] Distributed tracing
- [ ] Health check endpoints

